### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:42000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "UserName": "qwe",
    "Password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de buscar todos os pacientes
GET http://localhost:42000/getAllPacientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar paciente por ID
GET http://localhost:42000/getPacienteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de inserção de paciente
